  <h2 style="margin-top:14px">Andon aktif</h2><ul id="act"><li style="color:#94a3b8;list-style:none;margin-left:-18px">Tidak ada</li></ul>
 </div>
 <div class="card"><h2>Pengaturan</h2>
  <label for="jph">JPH (job per jam)</label><input id="jph" type="number" min="0">
  <label for="target">Target (qty)</label><input id="target" type="number" min="0">
  <label for="interval">Interval tambah qty (detik)</label><input id="interval" type="number" min="1">
  <label for="ct">Cycle time (menit)</label><input id="ct" type="number" min="0">
  <label for="sh">Jam mulai produksi (WIB, 0-23,99)</label><input id="sh" type="number" min="0" max="23.99" step="0.25">
  <label for="ho">Handover</label><input id="ho" type="number" min="0">
  <div class="sw"><input id="auto" type="checkbox" style="width:22px;height:22px"><label for="auto" style="margin:0;color:#e2e8f0">Qty bertambah otomatis (berhenti saat ada andon)</label></div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:14px"><button id="save">Simpan</button><button class="sec" id="defs">Kembali ke bawaan</button></div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Start produksi</h2>
  <div style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px">Efisiensi dihitung dari titik start ini: 100% bila tidak ada downtime unplanned. Planned (istirahat, briefing, changeover, preventive maintenance, finish production) tidak mengurangi.</div>
  <div class="row"><button id="startnow" class="amb">Mulai produksi sekarang</button></div>
 </div>
 <div class="card"><h2>Aksi manual</h2>
  <div class="row"><button id="p1">+1 qty</button><button id="p5" class="sec">+5</button><button id="m1" class="sec">-1</button></div>
  <label for="n">Tambah qty (jumlah bebas)</label>
  <div class="row"><input id="n" type="number" value="1" style="max-width:130px"><button id="addn">Tambah</button></div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Reset</h2>
  <div class="row"><button class="amb" id="clr">Akhiri andon aktif</button><button class="red" id="rdt">Reset downtime</button><button class="red" id="rqty">Reset qty</button></div>
  <div style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;margin-top:8px"><b>Akhiri andon aktif</b>: line jalan lagi, riwayat tetap. <b>Reset downtime</b>: hapus semua riwayat andon. <b>Reset qty</b>: Assy Out kembali 0.</div>
 </div>
</div>
<div class="msg" id="msg"></div>
<script>
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);let busy=false,dirty=false;
const fmt=s=>{s=Math.max(0,Math.round(s));const m=Math.floor(s/60);return m+' mnt '+(s%60)+' dtk'};
function show(s,fromForm){
 $('qty').textContent=s.assyOut;$('vTarget').textContent=s.cfg.target;$('vJph').textContent=s.cfg.jph;
